title Vinyl Knock-knock: three quick taps on the cover switch the screen off (all black): a tap on the output button and the keys Q, Esc, M then do nothing; three quick taps on the output button bring it back and press nothing (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1
env VINYL_DEMO_KNOCK 1

wait 800
@480x320 tapxy 0.196 0.406
@320x480 tapxy 0.344 0.287
@480x320 tapxy 0.196 0.406
@320x480 tapxy 0.344 0.287
@480x320 tapxy 0.196 0.406
@320x480 tapxy 0.344 0.287
wait 300
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect notext "Automatic"
key q
wait 300
expect notext "Move up"
key esc
wait 300
key m
wait 300
expect notext "Sleep timer"
shot 01-off-black-nothing-acted
tap "Evolve 65"
tap "Evolve 65"
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect notext "Automatic"
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect text "Automatic"
shot 02-output-after-wake
expect noquit
